"description":"Leave every doctor visit knowing exactly what to do next.\nKin helps you prep your questions before the visit, takes the notes during it, and gives you a clear summary and to-do list afterward.\nKin works in English and Spanish. It takes notes in either language and can give you your summary and next steps in English and Spanish.\nWHAT KIN DOES\nPrep for the visit\nTell Kin about an upcoming appointment and it builds your agenda with you, asking who the visit is for and what you want out of it. Edit, reorder, or add your own questions, symptoms, photos, and documents.\nTake the notes\nStart Kin in the exam room or on a video visit, and focus on your doctor.\nGet a clear summary\nThe key points and recommendations from your visit, ready to read or to have Kin read to you. Remember exactly what the doctor said about your medications and next steps.\nOne to-do list for everyone you care for\nMedications, lab work, referrals, and follow-ups from every visit, in one place. Open any task to see which visit it came from.\nTalk and listen\nUse your voice at every step. Talk through your agenda before the visit, ask Kin about what was discussed afterward, It works from any chat.  Have Kin read your summary and to-dos back to you.\nShare with people involved with your care\nYou decide who to share visits with. Coordinate care with family and caregivers, share summaries and next steps, and remove anyone anytime.\nBUILT FOR REAL CARE\nAging parents and loved ones: help an aging parent or spouse remember what the doctor said, stay on top of medications and follow-ups, and keep the whole family in the loop.\nChronic and ongoing care: for chronic conditions, cancer care, and specialist visits, Kin keeps every appointment, instruction, and next step in one place, so nothing gets lost between visits.\nYour own care: a running history of visits across doctors and specialists.\nWomen's health: fertility, pregnancy, postpartum, and menopause.\nStore your records, images and notes so you can bring them into the visit and keep what comes next organized.\nAlso for kids' appointments and vet visits.\nBUILT ALONGSIDE DOCTORS\nKin doesn't diagnose, prescribe, or replace your doctor. It helps you understand what was discussed and follow the care plan you were given.\nPRIVACY AND CONTROL\nYour health information is yours. You choose who sees it, and you can delete your notes and summaries anytime.", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "averageUserRating":4.8482099999999999084820956340990960597991943359375, "trackCensoredName":"Kin - Remember Doctor Visits", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/kin-remember-doctor-visits/id6756894542?uo=4", "userRatingCount":1120}]
